ch that atoms in different gate sites are no closer than 10 $mu$m during the gate. At our present $n = 53$ and two-photon Rabi frequency of 4.6 MHz, the blockade radius is roughly 4.3 $mu$m, such that adjacent atoms are well-within blockade and distant atoms are well-outside blockade.
